<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">Qolaasiyasa Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc1">Qolaasiyasa Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc3">Qola</para>
  <para style="toc2">Qolaasiyasa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosi Qolaasiyasa Asaas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafida Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosi Qolaasiyasa asaas xaafida kiitay xaafetiday, Guutha Iisen, Efesoonape doloha baggara de7iya Qolaasiyasa kataman de7iya woosa keethasa. He woosa keetha essiday Phawuloosa gidonna ixikoka, Roome biittan Iise waanna katama gidida Efesoonape wongela odiya asaa kiittey iya gidiya gisho, Qolaasiyasaska iyaw aawatethi de7ees. Qolaasiyasa woosa keethan, “Xoosse eranawunne kumetha atotethi demmanaw asi ubbay ayyaana wolqatanne maatata goyinnanaw koshshees” giya wordo astamaareti de7eysa Phawuloosi si7is. He astamaareti tamaarsiya harabay qassi, “Asi ubbay qaxaro daaniya wogatas haaretanawunne katha woga ubba naaganaw koshshees” yaagosona.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosi ha kiitaa xaafiday, tuma ammano timirtiya tamaarsidi, enta wordo timirtiya laallanaasa. I zaarida zaarotape issoy, “Yesuus Kiristoosi kumetha atotethi immees; hara haymaanotetinne oosoti iyape haassosona” yaagees. Xoossay Kiristoosa baggara alamiya medhis; qassi iya baggara zaaridi baako ehana. Ha alamiyas atotetha ufaysi de7ey Kiristoosa ammanonna. Hessa gisho, Phawuloosi ha gita timirtey ammaniya asaa de7on waanidi ooson pee7anaw bessiyako odees. Ha kiitaynne Efesoona asaas xaafida kiitay, banta oykida qofaninne kiitan woli daanosona. Ha nam7u maxaafata giddon de7iya dummatethay, Efesoonan Kiristoosi woosa keethas huuphe, Qolaasiyasan Kiristoosi medhetethas huuphe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha kiita Phawuloosape ekidi Qolaasiyasa gathanaw bida Tikiqoosara issife de7ey Anasmoosa gideysa erisoy maaddiyaba. Ayis giiko, Phawuloosi Anasmoosa geetetiya ba oosanchuwaba Filmoonas hara kiita xaafis.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo qofa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="COL 1:1-8">1:1-8</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galata woosa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="COL 1:3-8">1:3-8</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristoosi oone <char style="ior">(<ref loc="COL 1:9-2:19">1:9—2:19</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristoosan de7iya ooratha de7o <char style="ior">(<ref loc="COL 2:20-4:6">2:20—4:6</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kuusha qofanne sarotho <char style="ior">(<ref loc="COL 4:7-18">4:7-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1"/>Xoossaa shenen Kiristoosi Yesuusa hawaare gidida Phawuloosinne nu ishaa Ximotiyoosi, <verse eid="COL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2"/>Qolaasiyasa kataman de7iya Kiristoosan geeshshatasinne ammanetida asaas xaafida kiitaa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:2">Xoossaa nu Aawape aadho keehatethaynne sarotethay hintew gido.<verse eid="COL 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Galata Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3"/>Nuuni hintew woossiya wode Xoossaa nu Godaa, Yesuus Kiristoosa Aawa ubba wode galatoos. <verse eid="COL 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4"/>Nuuni Kiristoos Yesuusan de7iya hinte ammanuwanne geeshshata ubbaas de7iya hinte siiquwa si7ida. <verse eid="COL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5"/>Hessa hinte oothiday hinte ufaysay salon hintew naagetida gishosa. Hinte tuma kiitta gidida Wongela koyro ammanida wode he ufaysaa si7ideta. <verse eid="COL 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6"/>Hinte he Wongela si7ida wodenne Xoossaa aadho keehatetha tumaa shaaki erida wodepe doomidi hinte giddon hanidaysada biitta ubban diccishenne ayfishe de7ees.<verse eid="COL 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7"/>Hinte hessa nuura issife Kiristoosas oothiya ammanetida, dosetida Ephafirape tamaarideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:12">Qola 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Filmo 23</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8"/>I hessa bolla gujidi Ayyaanay hintew immida siiquwaba nuus odis.<verse eid="COL 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9"/>Hessa gisho, nuuni hintebaa si7ida gallasaape doomidi, Xoossay ba sheniya hintena bessaana melanne, Geeshsha Ayyaanay immiya eratethaninne cincatetha ubban hintena kunthana mela ubba wode hintew Xoossaa woossoos. <verse eid="COL 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10"/>Hessadaka, hinte, Goday koyeysada daana mela, ubba wode iya ufaysana mela, lo77o ooso ubban hinte ayfe ayfana melanne Xoossaa aathidi erishe diccana mela Xoossaa woossoos.<verse eid="COL 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11"/>Xoossaa boncho wolqay hinte ubbaba gencanaadanne danda7anaada ba minotethaa immidi hintena ufayso. <verse eid="COL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12"/>Qassi geeshshata poo7o kawotethaa laattana mela hintena oothida Aawa galatite. <verse eid="COL 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13"/>I nuna dhuma wolqaafe ashshidi ba dosiya na7aa kawotethaako ehis. <verse eid="COL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14"/>Iyan wozetidi iya suuthan nagara atotethi demmida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:7">Efe 1:7</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="COL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15"/>Kiristoosi bentonna Xoossaas tuma leemiso. I medhetetha ubbaafe bayra. <verse eid="COL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16"/>Ubbabay iya baggara medhetis. Bentiyabatinne bentonnabati, wolqatinne godati, haareysatinne maata aawati, saloninne sa7an de7iya ubbay iyawunne iya baggara medhetis. <verse eid="COL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17"/>I ubbabaape kase de7ees. Ubbabay iyan ba bessan bessan oyketidi de7ees. <verse eid="COL 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18"/>I ba asatethi gidida woosa keethas huuphe. I ubbaafe bolla gidanaw hayqope dendon sinthenne bayra.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:22-23">Efe 1:22-23</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="COL 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19"/>Xoossay ba kumetha Xoossatethaara iyan daanaw koyis. <verse eid="COL 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20"/>Qassi masqaliya bolla gussida ba na7aa suuthan sarotethi medhidi saloninne sa7an de7iya ubbaa iya baggara baara sigethis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:16">Efe 2:16</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="COL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21"/>Haysafe kase hinte qofaa iitatethay hintena Xoossaafe shaakisinne iyara morke oothis; hinte oosoyka iita. <verse eid="COL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22"/>Shin ha77i Kiristoosi ashon hayqida hayquwa baggara Xoossay hintena baara sigethidi, geeshshata, borey baynaysatanne xillota oothis. <verse eid="COL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23"/>Hinte, hinte ammanuwan qaaxonna minnidinne xaphidi daanaw bessees. Hinte Wongela qaala si7ida wode ekida ufaysaa minthi oykite. He Wongelay hinte si7idaysanne biitta ubban sabbaketidaysa. Ta, Phawuloosika ha Wongelas oosancho gidas.<verse eid="COL 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Hawaaretetha Ooso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24"/>Taani hinte gisho ha77i ekiya waayan ufaytayis. Kiristoosi iya asatethi gidida woosa keethaas ekida waayiya taani ta ashuwan polayis. <verse eid="COL 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25"/>Xoossaa qaala hintew polada odana mela taw imetida maatan woosa keethaas oosancho gidas. <verse eid="COL 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26"/>Ha qaalay kase aadhida wodiyan yeletethaa ubbaafe geemmidi de7is. Shin ha77i Xoossay ha xuuraa ammaniya ubbaas qoncisis. <verse eid="COL 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27"/>Xoossay Ayhude gidonna asaa giddon ha xuuraa boncho duretetha qoncisis. Ika boncho ufaysi gidida hinte giddon de7iya Kiristoosa.<verse eid="COL 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28"/>Hessa gisho, issi issi asi Kiristoosan kumetha asi oothidi shiishanaw cincatetha ubban asaa tamaarsoninne zoren Kiristoosaba sabbakoos. <verse eid="COL 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29"/>Xoossay ba gita wolqan tanan oothiya gisho, ha77i gakanaw iya wolqan baaxetaysinne daaburayis.<verse eid="COL 1:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="COL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1"/>Ta hintewunne Loodoqe kataman de7iya asaas, hessadaka tana ayfen be7iboona asa ubbaas ay mela baaxetiyako hinte erana mela koyayis. <verse eid="COL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2"/>Ta baaxetiya gaasoyka enti banta wozanan minnidi, siiqon qashetidi, polo gidida kumetha akeeka duretetha demmidi Xoossaa xuuraa Kiristoosa erana melasa. <verse eid="COL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3"/>Iyan Xoossay minjida eraynne cincatetha ubbay de7ees.<verse eid="COL 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4"/>Ta hessa oonika hintena cimo qaalan balethonna mela koyada gayis. <verse eid="COL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5"/>Ta hintefe haakada de7ikoka ayyaanan hintera de7ayis. Hinte duussaa maaranne Kiristoosa hinte minnidi ammaneysa be7ada ufaytayis.<verse eid="COL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosan Kumetha De7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6"/>Hinte Godaa Kiristoos Yesuusa ekidaysada iyan de7ite. <verse eid="COL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7"/>Iyan xapho yeddite; iyan keexetite. Hinte tamaaridaysada ammanon minnite; Xoossaas kumidi palahida galataa immite.<verse eid="COL 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8"/>Kiristoosape gidonashin, asa woganinne ha alamiya coo wogan katida timirteninne asape yida eratethan oonika hintena cimi balethidi di77onna mela naagetite. <verse eid="COL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9"/>Xoossaa Xoossatethay Kiristoosa asatethan kumethi de7ees. <verse eid="COL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10"/>Hinteka maatasinne wolqa ubbaas huuphe gidiya Kiristoosan kumideta.<verse eid="COL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11"/>Hinte Kiristoosa ammanidi qaxaretideta. Hessika asa kushen gidonashin, hintena iita hanotethaafe diggiya Kiristoosan oosetida qaxaretethi. <verse eid="COL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12"/>Hinte xammaqetida wode Kiristoosara issife moogetidi, Kiristoosa hayqope denthida Xoossaa wolqaa ammanidi, Kiristoosara issife dendideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:4">Roome 6:4</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="COL 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13"/>Hinte, hinte nagaraa gishonne hinte ceega asatethaa qaxaretonna gisho hayqidi de7ishin, Xoossay hinte nagaraa atto gis. Kiristoosara hintew de7o immis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:1-5">Efe 2:1-5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14"/>I nuna mootiyanne nuura eqetiya, nu bolla xaafetida acuwa daakidi masqaliya bolla dhishidi ogepe diggis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:15">Efe 2:15</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15"/>Kiristoosi wolqatanne maatata masqaliyan xoonidi, enta ola dancuwa bilisidi, di7etida asada enta qoncen yuushshi bessis.<verse eid="COL 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16"/>Hessa gisho, miyaban woyko uyaaban, ba7aale gallas woyko ageeni xeeriya qamma bonchon oonika hinte bolla pirdofo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:1-6">Roome 14:1-6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17"/>Haysati sinthafe yaanaw de7iyabatas eesho, shin tumay Kiristoosa. <verse eid="COL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18"/>Qoodhepe qommo ashketethaninne kiitancho goyinnon ceeqetiya oonika hintena hinte woytuwape ashshofo. Hessa mela asi ba be7ida qoncethan nashetishe ba asho qofan coo otortees. <verse eid="COL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19"/>Hessa mela asaas huuphe gidida Kiristoosara gahetethi baawa. I asatethaa ubbaa shayaninne keson keson gathi oythidi muzidi dichees. Xoossay hessa mela ogen asatethaa ubbaas dichi immees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:16">Efe 4:16</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="COL 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ooratha De7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20"/>Hinte Kiristoosara hayqidi ha alamiya haariya ayyaanata wolqaafe la77a keydeta. Yaatin, ayis shaaketonna asada gididi ha wogatas haretetii? <verse eid="COL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21"/>He wogati, “Oykofa; laacofa; bochofa” geeteteysata. <verse eid="COL 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22"/>Ha ubbay asa woganne timirte gidiya gisho ooso bolla pee7idaape guye dhayana. <verse eid="COL 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23"/>Ha kiitati bonchonne cincatethi daanidi bentanaw danda7oosona. Ha wogati Xoosse daro dosisiyaba, ashkenne hinte asatethaa haarisiyaba daanosona, shin nu iita amotetha bolla entaw wolqi baawa.<verse eid="COL 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1"/>Hiza, hinte Kiristoosara hayqope dendidaysada, Xoossaafe ushacha baggan uttida Kiristoosi de7iya bessan, salon de7iyabata koyite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz 110:1</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2"/>Salon de7eyisata bolla hinte qofaa wothitepe attishin, sa7an de7iyabata bolla wothofite. <verse eid="COL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3"/>Hinte hayqon shaaketida mela ha alamiyape shaaketideta. Hinte de7oy Kiristoosara issife Xoossan geemmis. <verse eid="COL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4"/>Hintew de7o gidida Kiristoosi qonciya wode he wode hinteka iyara bonchon qoncana.<verse eid="COL 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5"/>Hessa gisho, hintenan de7iya alame amotta wodhite. Hessatika laymatethi, tunatethi, laymatanaw amotethi, eeqa goyinno mela gidida uuzetethi. <verse eid="COL 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6"/>Hayisata gaason Xoossaa hanqoy kiitetonna asaa bolla yaana. <verse eid="COL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7"/>Hinteka kase he iita ogiyan biya asaa giddon de7ishe haysata oothideta.<verse eid="COL 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8"/>Ha77i hinte hessata oothopite. Qassi hanqo, ixo, kachi, zigirsinne borso oda hintefe diggit. <verse eid="COL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9"/>Ceega asatethaa iya oosuwara hintefe qaarida gisho, issoy issuwas wordotopite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:22">Efe 4:22</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10"/>Xoossaa medho daaniya, eratethan laametida ooratha asatethaa ma7ite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Medhe 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:24">Efe 4:24</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11"/>Ha ooratha medhetethan, Girike asi woyko Ayhude asi, qaxaretiday woyko qaxaretonnay, Barbare asi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Barbare asi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Guussay tamaariboonna woyko eronna woyko yeletida mela si77i gidi de7iya asi guussu.</char></note> woyko Iskute asi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Iskute asi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Guusay wozana mino asi woyko wozana iita asi guussu.</char></note> aylley woyko womaannoy baawa. Kiristoosi ubbaa; I ubban de7ees.<verse eid="COL 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12"/>Hessa gisho, Xoossan dooretida asada geeshshatanne dosetidaysata gididi, maarotethaa, keehatetha, ashketethanne danda7a ma7ite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:2">Efe 4:2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13"/>Issoy issuwa danda7ite. Oonika ba laggiyan qohetidabay de7iko iyaw atto go. Goday hintew atto gidaysada hinteka wolis atto giite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:32">Efe 4:32</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14"/>He ubbaa bolla ubbaba issife shiishidi qachiya siiqo ma7ite. <verse eid="COL 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15"/>Xoossay hintena issi asi oothidi xeegiday, sarotethaas gidiya gisho Kiristoosa sarotethay hinte wozanaa haaro.<verse eid="COL 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16"/>Kiristoosa qaalay hinte wozanan kumidi de7o. Cincatetha ubban issoy issuwa tamaarsitenne zorite. Mazmuren, sabaninne ayyaana yethan Xoossaa wozanape galatishe yexite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:19-20">Efe 5:19-20</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17"/>Xoossaa Aawa Yesuusa baggara galatishe hinte odetiyaba woyko oothiyaba ubbaa Godaa Yesuusa sunthan oothite.<verse eid="COL 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammaniya Asa Duusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18"/>Macheto, ammaniya asaas bessiyaba gidiya gisho, hinte azinatas haaretite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:22">Efe 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1 Phex 3:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="COL 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19"/>Azinatoo, hinte macheta siiqite; entaw iitopite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:25">Efe 5:25</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1 Phex 3:7</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="COL 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20"/>Nayto, hintena yelidaysatas ubbaban kiitetite; hessi Godaa ufaysiyabaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:1">Efe 6:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="COL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21"/>Aawato, hinte nayti ufaysi qanxonna mela enta camethofite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:4">Efe 6:4</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="COL 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22"/>Aylleto, sa7an hintew godaa gididaysatas ubbaban kiitetite. Godaa bonchishe suure wozanape kiitetidi enta ufaysitepe attishin, asi be7o gidi oothopite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:5-8">Efe 6:5-8</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23"/>Hinte oothiya ooso ubbaa asas gidonashin, Godaas oothiya mela wozanape oothite. <verse eid="COL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24"/>Godaape laata woyto oothidi hinte ekeysa erite; hinte Godaa Kiristoosa haggaazeeta. <verse eid="COL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25"/>Xoossay asa som7o be7idi pirdonna gisho, oonika iita ooso oothiko ba iita oosuwa gisho zaaro ekana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:5-8">Efe 6:5-8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="COL 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="COL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1"/>Godato, hintewuka qassi salon Goday de7eysa eridi, hinte aylletas xillotethaninne issuwa issuwafe shaakonna koshshiyaba oothite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:9">Efe 6:9</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="COL 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2"/>Xoossaa barkidi galatishe qanxonna woossite. <verse eid="COL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3"/>Xoossay ba qaalas penge dooyana melanne taani hessa gaason qashon de7iya Kiristoosa xuuraa awaajana mela nuuska woossite. <verse eid="COL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4"/>Qassi taka besseysada qaala qoncisada odana mela taw Xoossaa woossite.<verse eid="COL 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5"/>Injetiya wode ubbaa go7etishe ammanonna asaa matan cincatethan de7ite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:16">Efe 5:16</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6"/>Hinte asa ubbaas koshshiya zaaro imo erana mela hinte oday ubba wode aadho keehatethan kumidaysanne maxineda mal7iyabaa gidanaw bessees.<verse eid="COL 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7"/>Nu siiqo ishay Tikiqoosi, taara issife Godaa oosuwan aylle gidida, ammanetiya oosanchoy, ta de7uwabaa hintew odana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Hawa 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2 Ximo 4:12</ref>.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:21-22">Efe 6:21-22</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8"/>Taani iya hinteko kiittiday, nu waanidi de7iyako hintew odidi hintena minthethana melasa. <verse eid="COL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9"/>Anasmoosi, ammanetiya siiqo ishay, hinte baggay, iyara hinteko bees. Enti haysan haniyaba ubbaa hintew odana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:10-12">Filmo 10-12</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="COL 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10"/>Taara qashetida Arisxirokoosinne Barnabaasa ishaa na7ay Marqoosi, hintena saro yaagosona. Ta hintew kase odidaysada Marqoosi hinteko biiko iya mokite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Hawa 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27:2</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Filmo 24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:12">Hawa 12:12</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11"/>Yesuusa geetetiya Yasxoosi hintena saro saro yaagees. Xoossaa kawotethaa gisho taara oothiya asata giddofe Ayhude gididaysati ha heedzata; enti tana daro minthethidosona.<verse eid="COL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12"/>Hinte baggay, Kiristoos Yesuusa aylley, Ephafiri hintena saro saro yaagees. I hinte Xoossaa sinthan minnidi eqanaadanne Xoossaa sheniya eridi polana mela ubba wode Xoossaa hinte gisho woossees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:7">Qola 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Filmo 23</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13"/>I hinte gishonne Loodoqeninne Hirapolisa kataman de7iya asaa gisho daro daaburidaysa ta markatayis.<verse eid="COL 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14"/>Nu siiqo ishay dottorey Luqaasinne Deemasi, hintena saro saro yaagosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:10-11">2 Ximo 4:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Filmo 24</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15"/>Loodoqen de7iya nu ishatas, Nimfaasinne I keethan shiiqiya asaas nu sarothuwa odite.<verse eid="COL 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16"/>Ha dabdaabiya hinte nabbabidaape guye, Loodoqe woosa keethan nabbabisite. Hinteka Loodoqe woosa keethay hintew yeddiya dabdaabiya nabbabite. <verse eid="COL 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17"/>Qassi Arkiphaasa, “Goday new immida oosuwa polanaysa dogopa” yaagidi qofisite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:2">Filmo 2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="COL 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18"/>Taani, Phawuloosi, ha sarothuwa ta kushen xaafas. Ta qashuwa qopite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 4:18">Xoossaa aadho keehatethay hintera gido.<verse eid="COL 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4"/>
</usx>
